note kwa: the words of target a64efi, 0 for any other word: efi (178) and the firmware words fwcall 250,
note fwld 251, fwst 252, fwsys 253, fwadr 254. They are not in fn kw (the chain gate18 compares with
note genkw.awk), so under every other target these stay ordinary names. Read where a value starts.
