ret 0
end

note kwx: w is reserved under the current target beyond fn kw's chain: under target a64efi the words of
note fn kwa. A program may not define a variable, a global, a constant, a text or a function with such
note a name (error 16, as for a keyword; checked where every name is entered, newname and addname): where
note a value starts the word would win and the name be ignored.
fn kwx w ulong to ulong
if eq get xefa 0 0
ret 0
end
ret kwa w
end

