end

note addname: packed name, register, type, length, kind, address. om4 ADDNAME. The table grows with the
note arena (group 3); at twice as many names as buckets the buckets double (nm_build).
fn addname w ulong r ulong t ulong ln ulong k ulong a ulong to void
if ne kwx w 0
note d2site 55|addname: syntax: unknown or misplaced word; condition if ne kwx w 0
put d2site 0 55
fail 16
end
n = get nn 0
if ge n get a_gp 3
a_need 3 n
end
put a_ar add get a_rb 3 n w
a_pc 4 n uchar r
a_pc 5 n uchar t
put a_ar add get a_rb 6 n ln
a_pc 7 n uchar k
put a_ar add get a_rb 8 n a
a_pc 9 n 0
a_pc 12 n 0
a_pc 13 n 0
a_pc 14 n 0
a_pc 10 n 0
a_pc 11 n 0
nm_link n
put nn 0 add n 1
if ge add n 1 shl ulong 2 get nh_b 0
put nh_b 0 add get nh_b 0 1
if ge sub shl ulong 1 get nh_b 0 1 get a_gp 4
a_need 4 sub shl ulong 1 get nh_b 0 1
end
nm_build add n 1
end
end

