end

note force: put a value (kind 1 register, 3 number, 4 flags, 9 float in a twin: FMOV Xr, Dn) in register
note r; a bare number is error 11
fn force k ulong v ulong t ulong r ulong to void
if ne get xtarget 0 0
if eq k 1
xload 0 v
xstore 0 r
ret
end
end
if eq k 1
if ne v r
emit or or 2852127712 r shl v 16
end
ret
end
