if ne lo 0
emit or or base 1023 shl lo 10
end
hi = and shr bytes 12 4095
if ne hi 0
emit or or base 4195327 shl hi 10
end
end

note spadd and spsub move SP for a transient push (a save area, a host word's private buffer) and keep
note osp, the bytes of transient push live at this point of the emitted code, and osmax, its largest value
note in the function. A native object records stkbytes + osmax as the function's own stack, so the
note module linker's whole-program stack proof covers every push. A pop larger than osp sets osbad;
note an object function with osbad set, or osp not 0 at its end, is refused (fnend), never under-reported.
