if ne uchar get a_ar add get a_rb 23 sub fe 1 12
note d2site 317|s_inlx: a function with a result can reach its end; condition if ne uchar get a_ar add get a_rb 23 sub fe 1 12
put d2site 0 317
fail 18
end
cp_post 0 0 12
end
