note stubs: the trap stubs of trap sites p .. n - 1: shared tail, function mode MOV X0, X7; LDR X16,
note [X7, #16]; BR X16 (C6.2.282, C6.2.216, C6.2.46: OscRt.trap); program mode ADD X0, X1, #100; MOVZ X8,
note #93; SVC #0 (exit 100 + code). Per trap code used: MOVZ X1, #code (C6.2.285); B tail. Each site's
note B.cond is patched to its code's stub. om4 FINISH, for the sites of a whole function.
