note s_eof: end of input: no open function (error 15), some function (16); function mode: no globals or
note texts (9, fnstore; consts fold and are allowed); one function: its bare words; more: the entry word, a
note B to the last function. om4 S_EOF.
note Resolve every call after all addresses are known. In function mode a function is settled when every
note function it calls is (leaves of the call graph first); any function left unsettled forms or reaches a
note cycle (error 9). ksettle finds the same set as the old nf rounds over every call, in linear time.
