ksettle n
kunset
end
end

note ksettle: Kahn's order over the n call records (callfrom 0 is no function's call and is skipped).
note k_deg: the calls function f makes to functions not yet settled; k_st / k_ed: the callers of each
note callee, grouped by callee (k_st g .. k_st g + 1 - 1 in k_ed), k_cu the fill cursor; k_q: the
note settled functions in order. A function is settled when its count reaches 0. Arena groups 19, 20.
