put a_ar add get a_rb 77 add x 7 get nslot 0
op = lenval 4
if gt op 14
note d2site 608|aefival: unknown target, an AArch64-only path on another target, or an x86efi refusal (bare unit, Linux host word, efi OP literal outside 0..14); condition if gt op 14
put d2site 0 608
fail 25
end
