note d2site 612|aefival: word or declaration in a place that does not allow it; condition if ne a_gu 37 pe 0
put d2site 0 612
fail 9
end
if ne ulong a_gu 35 pe 5
note d2site 613|aefival: word or declaration in a place that does not allow it; condition if ne ulong a_gu 35 pe 5
put d2site 0 613
fail 9
